（《淚之女王》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137028815223001088418279.jpeg/0hzs4417dd8r_eGxQEVAfhyxyy6iRxE5EiriNBIq4jQ\"/><figcaption>金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137028817534193664083125.jpeg/0UMHSJUt-aYbkyiJEZj_k26pyCiReJexFegSgRXoEoE\"/><figcaption>金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金智媛舊照（starnews）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251218/1078366366634872832617204.jpeg/nRonNvGUbgQz6ABBqi7qoD-SCB9T_bp8W3NPRFtzT0Q\"/><figcaption>金智媛舊照（starnews）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240508/864886469712678912983467.jpeg/v9nLi49DbO3q46COFr02gyzfNpec9WgZADVDZQA1Q2U\"/><figcaption>金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240508/864886466428407808618032.jpeg/KqjXOQUPGpR7Mn7_gdll9NiB6DEEe24XrQ8sBq0PLAY\"/><figcaption>金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240508/864886471092736000704825.jpeg/Mqy1_4HScxMNGc0iM-FyWHKiujCfqGooIQmNOyEJjTs\"/><figcaption>金智媛舊照（IG@geewonii）</figcaption></figure><p>47歲長這樣太驚人！河智苑炸腹肌熱舞　「超絕美貌」驚呆網：不輸現役偶像</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-01T13:39:10.712151+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1916,"images":33,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}